3
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,200
Unlimited drinks for lawyers

4
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,200
Wouldn’t that mean one and a half months of cultivation?

5
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,200
Almost everything including food and clothing is included.

6
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,730
But there are some strange things

7
00:00:11,730 --> 00:00:13,930
If you think your work is worse than that of your leader

8
00:00:13,930 --> 00:00:15,730
You can challenge it anytime yet

9
00:00:15,730 --> 00:00:18,130
There is also this way of promotion

10
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:20,130
No wonder the Secretary-General is so young

11
00:00:20,130 --> 00:00:22,530
This company is so full of energy

12
00:00:22,530 --> 00:00:25,650
what you want

13
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:27,450
I'll send out the cow box later and take a closer look.

14
00:00:27,450 --> 00:00:28,450
good secretary

15
00:00:28,450 --> 00:00:33,060
